    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really worried about the cost and the wait times at the hospital... it's like 11pm and i'm pretty sure i'm just exhausted. do u think there's any way i can just check it at home? like could i take some eye drops or something to make the spots go away so i can sleep it off? i just really need to know if i'm actually in danger or if i'm just overreacting here.",
